  "details": "After publishing a quest version of a world/avatar, the player will be flagged as playing on a quest even when the client is active on pc\nRepro Steps: 1. Have a PC client open\n2. published a world/avatar with an android build target via the unity sdk\n3. the game will now report that the player is playing on a quest\nExpected: After publishing the player continues to be shown as a pc player\nActual: After publishing the player will be shown as a quest player, along with\n-pc only world portal being shown as unjoinable (visual only)\n-shown as quest in the social tab\n-other players can't invite said playing into a pc only world\n\nVRChat Version: 2021.4.2\nsdk version: 2021.11.08.14.28",
